استورد compiler.diagnostics.identity;
// Contextual reasons: the precise cause a producer attaches to a public
// diagnostic identity. Compiler-owned policy (like identity.sn and registry.sn):
// the producer chooses the reason, iSpeak (compiler/ispeak) supplies its words.
// A reason is never shown as a code; its machine key is a stable token for
// machine-readable output (JSON) and tools, never parsed back for meaning.
